WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:10.980
Please don't expect too much from it.
This story is a simple illustration of the three
Minami sisters and the ordinary life they lead.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.770
Sensei...

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:13.860
Ninomiya-kun.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:14.490
Sensei!

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.020
Ninomiya-kun!

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.290
Sensei!
Ninomiya-kun!

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:16.870
Huh? S-Sannomiya-kun?!
Sensei!

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:17.680
Huh? S-Sannomiya-kun?!

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:17.710
Sensei?
Huh? S-Sannomiya-kun?!

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.410
Sensei?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:19.870
Ninomiya-kun.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.500
Done.
Ninomiya-kun.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.310
Done.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka-neesama, we're done.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.860
That was pretty fast.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.170
Did you actually clean yourself?

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.150
All you gotta do is get in,
wash up, and get out.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.680
A quick splash is enough.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.000
Don't worry.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.680
She washed herself.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.430
Touma is, like...

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.430
pretty fast.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.440
It's okay to be fast,
but at least dry yourself.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.860
C'mere. I'll dry your hair for you.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.820
You know, you don't
.have to rush it like that.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.420
I can't take the heat for very long.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.480
Though, my brother Natsuki
.takes pretty long baths.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.020
You can watch an entire episode
.of a TV drama before he's out.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.620
Oh, really?

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.280
There you go.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.440
Thanks.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.020
Do you have a change of clothes?

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.280
Oh, don't worry.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.630
I'll just wear the clothes I came in.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.680
They're still in the wash.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.350
Huh?

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.960
They're still in the wash.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.750
I wonder if we have some around.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.140
Let's see.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:26.700
Huh?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.770
Didn't we have an emergency pair of pajamas?

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:34.220
We did, but I gave them to Touma as
.materials the last time she was here.

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:36.280
Yeah. I'm making a buncha
.stuff with those clothes.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.220
That's no good.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:40.800
You'll catch a cold with
.nothing but that towel on.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.540
Here's something you can wear!

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.910
Why two?

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.860
Kana... one of those is mine, isn't it?

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.380
Which would you like?

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.370
The chest is too baggy,

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:01.540
and so is the butt area.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:04.640
Is this yours, Haruka?

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.860
The waist is a bit tight,

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.880
but the chest is perfect.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:15.320
Is this yours, Kana?

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.610
What are you trying to do?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.560
Just give me a tracksuit.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.000
Simply Put, It's a Roundabout Confession

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:01.820
You see, natural airheads
.actually exist in this world.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.180
I have a friend who cries when you ask her what time it is.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.310
What the heck?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.970
Oh, isn't Love Now on today?

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.310
It's really good!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.310
Oh, what's that?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.320
Miyuki, what time is it?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.360
Uh, it's...

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.210
It's cold!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.740
That's basically what happened.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.000
So she looked at her watch while holding a glass of water?

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.710
There's...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.750
There's no way someone
.that stupid could really exist.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.220
It's true!

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.800
This isn't some dream I had or some fairy tale I made up!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:40.930
You're joking.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.340
It's true!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.590
Let's perform an experiment, then.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.150
An experiment?

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.220
You sure like experiments and craft work, don't you, Touma?

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.600
Pretty much.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.890
I'm here!

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.040
Welcome, Uchida.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.430
Have a seat.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.400
Sure.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:01.550
Uchida, have something to drink.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.490
Sure.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.200
Uchida, what time is it?

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.430
It's, uh...

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.200
And there's your proof.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.460
Airheads <i>do</i> exist.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.640
What now, Chiaki?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:19.970
Do you finally understand?

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.280
Uchida is a special type of
.idiot, so she doesn't count.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.420
Hey!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.800
How can you call me an idiot after getting my clothes all soaked?

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.640
Uchida, what's with that outfit?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.140
That's what I wanted to ask <i>you</i>!

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:37.460
That's the emergency maid
.outfit Touma made for us.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.020
Keep it on until your clothes dry.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.530
Why don't you have any normal emergency clothing, Master?

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:45.640
By the way, we only have it in elementary schooler size.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.200
You're going to work me really hard, aren't you, Master?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:52.860
But still, we can't conclude the
.experiment after just one success.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:53.770
Yeah.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.870
It definitely won't go this
.way with the next person.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.130
Oh? Shall we proceed to
the next test subject, then?

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.050
With pleasure!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.170
So, who should our next subject be?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.240
It can't be someone like Uchida.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.310
I don't think it'd work on Yoshino.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.980
And I'd feel bad about using Mako-chan.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.110
Wait.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.510
Hey, Chiaki.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:19.940
Haruka was wearing a wristwatch when she went out earlier, wasn't she?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.180
Yeah, she was.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.910
She should be coming home soon.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.110
H-Hey, Kana.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:30.780
When Haruka wears a watch,
.she wears it on the inner wrist.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.330
The inner wrist?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:35.080
So... like this?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.750
Yep. Like this.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:40.620
Chiaki.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.120
When Haruka comes back,
could you try sitting next to her?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.460
What do you want me to try?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.380
I don't get it at all.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.170
Maid, go fetch us some water.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.920
Yes, Master.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.940
I don't think Haruka will fall for it.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:14.240
I'm back.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.370
Welcome back, Haruka-neesama.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.510
It is currently 4:12.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.630
Oh, a time announcer?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.260
It will shortly be 4:13.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.880
She doesn't have much faith in Haruka.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.170
Sensei...

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.110
Ninomiya-kun.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.890
Sensei!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.800
Ninomiya-kun!

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.860
Sensei!

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:37.070
Ninomiya-kun!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.390
Haruka, what time is it?
Ninomiya-kun!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.620
Haruka, what time is it?

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.460
Half-past three.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.660
Thanks...

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:43.360
Dang.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.080
Kana, could you show me your hands?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.640
Like this?

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.920
The backs of your hands.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.170
Thanks.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:54.970
Huh?

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.260
Huh?!

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.770
Hey, Haruka.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:58.910
Hey!

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.060
All right, Haruka. See you later.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:06.920
All right.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:08.510
Huh?

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.970
Oh, are you going to
Haruka-senpai's house?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.430
Yeah. She said she'll bake us a cake.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.000
Can I come too?!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.800
Sure...

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.000
That was so good!

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.680
Thanks, Haruka!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.370
It was delicious, Haruka-senpai.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.900
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.880
I ate way too much.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:31.370
Maki-senpai, you sure can eat a
.lot for someone who's so tiny.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.040
I'm not that tiny.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.240
I'm average for a small person.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:36.410
Even your hands are tiny, Maki.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.150
No, they're not.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.110
My fingers are long.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:43.040
Wanna see whose hands are bigger?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.110
Well, aren't you cocky?

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:46.210
Do you really think you can win?

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.710
Looks like they're both the same.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.920
But my fingers are more
.slender and beautiful.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.440
They're not that slender.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.050
No, no. They are.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:05.270
You could find out by
.having Maki try on that ring.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.420
Let's see for real, then.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.740
My pleasure!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.940
Haruka, shouldn't you stop them?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.490
I guess so...

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:22.050
Hey, let's cut it out.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.030
Okay?

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.640
So, what were we talking about?

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.320
Uh...

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.380
Oh, right.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:35.880
I was thinking Maki might fit in this maid uniform we have.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:38.740
I'll wear it... for a price.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.300
Boo.

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:42.560
Huh?

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.730
What's wrong, Hitomi?

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:48.510
Well, I was just wondering
where I left my ring.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.070
You didn't lose it, did you?
It looked expensive.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:55.330
My friend got it from her
.boyfriend and gave it to me.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.570
It cost tens of thousands of yen.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.470
Tens of thousands?!

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.820
It's not here.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.460
Or here.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:13.960
Huh?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:18.280
I thought I'd lost it, when all this time I had it clenched in my hand?

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.670
How embarrassing!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:27.480
There's no way I can admit to doing something that airheaded.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.820
But I don't think I can make it
.look like I randomly found it.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.260
If they asked me where it was,
..I don't think I could answer...

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:35.620
Did you find it?

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:36.950
No.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:39.350
Did it roll off to somewhere?

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:40.770
I can't do this!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.330
I'll try losing it again.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.130
It's just a little something
.I got off a friend.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.540
Please don't worry about it.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.540
But...

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.110
I think it only cost a few
.hundred yen, after all.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:57.370
That's two digits less.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.760
Are you sure your memory's okay?

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:02.090
So, what were we talking about?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.430
Let's see.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:07.480
I was going to wear a maid outfit, and
.Haruka was going to pay me in cash.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.430
I don't think so.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.230
The ring was in my bag?!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:17.740
Well, the ring must be somewhere in
.this room, so we'll find it eventually.

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:19.580
That's right.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.720
Atsuko, what's wrong?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.080
Oh, you found it?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.910
What a relief.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.080
Where was it?

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:34.460
I... I didn't do it.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.800
I don't know how to explain this,

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.760
but it was inside my bag.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.890
I'm so sorry.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:45.840
N-No, don't worry about it.

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.480
I don't know how to explain this either...

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.020
I'm sorry it went in your bag!

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.280
I'm sorry!

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:52.240
Me too!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.150
I'm sorry!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:54.020
Me too!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.730
I'm sorry!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.550
Me too!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.110
I'm sorry!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:00.550
Haruka, could you tell me why these two keep apologizing?

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.030
I wonder.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:16.820
So anyway, Touma made me some clothes.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:20.570
Really? I never would've thought Touma would be into sewing and stuff.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.110
On the contrary,

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.220
you'd be surprised at how
.good Touma's sewing is.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.640
Was there anything you wanted made?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.930
Huh? N-No, that'd be too embarrassing.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.290
Would it?

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.730
Oh, it's Natsuki-kun.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.660
Though, my brother Natsuki
.takes pretty long baths.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.740
You can watch an entire episode
.of a TV drama before he's out.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:43.820
Natsuki-kun.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.180
Yo.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:48.910
Touma told me that you take pretty long baths.

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.770
I take pretty long ones too, so—

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.640
No, I don't.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.580
I don't take long baths.

00:12:56.070 --> 00:13:00.460
You see, a bath is just like taking a quick splash.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.090
Super fast. Like a crow at a bird bath.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:04.560
Really?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.460
Damn it, Touma, don't go blurting out things you shouldn't.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.770
Haruka-senpai didn't need to know that.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.270
I mean, it's pretty embarrassing.

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:21.220
Huh?

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.280
That look of his...

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.620
Hey, Natsuki.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.660
What are you so embarrassed about?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:28.820
Hitomi.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.400
Apparently, I take long baths.

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.030
Huh? And that's embarrassing?

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:38.670
No, it's just...

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:42.590
His eyes are screaming with embarrassment.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.040
Huh? He takes long baths?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.090
Is that really something to
be embarrassed about?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.330
I guess taking long baths
is more of a girl thing,

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.980
so it makes sense that a guy
.would get all flustered.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:56.860
I see.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.730
So I basically embarrassed
.Natsuki-kun earlier.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.670
I'll be right back.
I forgot something.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:09.760
But why was he able to tell me about something embarrassing so easily?

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.910
So he told you stuff that he finds
embarrassing without even hesitating?

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.460
That must mean...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:20.420
He wants you to know everything about him, even things he finds embarrassing!

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.760
Simply put, it's a roundabout confession!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.910
Really?!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.470
No, I don't really know.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.830
Natsuki-kun!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.970
Oh, Haruka-senpai.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.810
I wanted to talk about the bath conversation we just had.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:41.400
Taking long baths improves your blood circulation and helps you relax.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.110
It's not good to just take a quick splash. Okay?

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.510
Yes.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.750
If you say so, Haruka-senpai, I'll do it.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.110
Good.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.460
Natsuki.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.620
About earlier...

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:59.960
I, uh... take long baths too.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:07.010
I get the feeling I just said
.something totally embarrassing.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.020
Long baths are good.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.760
They really improve your blood circulation.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:13.810
That's it?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:17.040
Plus, they help you relax a lot.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:21.270
I know they're good for your health, but isn't there something else you should tell me?!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.150
I totally embarrassed myself for this!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.240
There's nothing to feel embarrassed about.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.160
Huh?

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.970
How much longer are you
going to stay in there?

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.930
The drama we were watching is long over.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.920
Go watch a variety show too.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.660
Life is wonderful!

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.930
The donuts from that store sure are great.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.970
You said it.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:04.440
Each and every one is half-filled with pure happiness.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.770
What's the other half filled with?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.690
Does it matter?

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.700
Not really.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.790
Oh, we still have one donut left.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.060
All right, rock-paper-scissors for it.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.690
Sure.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:28.550
Okay!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.400
Rock...

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.130
paper...

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.050
scissors!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.530
You just waited for us to throw ours first.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:37.730
No I didn't.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:40.850
Time to get some more tea.

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:54.270
Now for my donut...

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.320
Oh?

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.830
Where could my little
donut have walked off to?

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.170
Chiaki, do you know where it went?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.330
Huh? I have no idea.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.280
I've been reading this entire time.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.340
What about you, Touma?

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:12.950
Dunno.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.840
I've been bugging Chiaki this whole time.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.270
I see.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:20.850
No, wait, you're lying!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.600
Which one of you ate it?!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.660
That's absurd.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:29.820
If one of us had eaten it, the other one would have called them out.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.360
That's right.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.650
Th-That means...

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.780
That means the donut was
.never there to begin with.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.070
It was never there to begin with?

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.790
Was it all an illusion?

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.820
The taste of powdered sugar...

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.660
There was definitely a donut here.

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:55.800
It was no illusion.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.110
Touma,

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.150
Chiaki.

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:02.310
The donuts you ate earlier
.didn't have powdered sugar.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.430
What... are you trying to say?

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:09.940
I'm saying that whoever ate the last donut would have traces of powdered sugar around their mouth.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:14.880
Now,

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.200
I will taste both of your mouths.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.660
We're sorry!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.490
We both ate it!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.000
Wow, I got you to spill the beans so easily.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.400
Well, whatever.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.860
I'll just have a taste to make sure.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:32.920
Go away!

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.090
What's going on here?

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.910
Oh, Haruka, welcome back.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.350
These two ate my donut.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.430
Oh, donuts?

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:45.750
Oh no!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:48.190
I forgot that the last donut was for...

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.200
Where's mine?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:53.610
A-Actually, there weren't any donuts here.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.350
I can smell something cinnamony on you.

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.400
Really?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.530
Well, they <i>do</i> say I'm as sweet
as cinnamon, you know.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.370
Didn't you eat the cinnamon-glazed one?

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:09.710
The cinnamon-glazed what?

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.330
What? Well...

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.530
They ate your donut!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.290
That was the leftover one!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.340
Yeah, yeah.
That was the leftover one!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:24.040
No! That was just because I
.forgot about Haruka's share.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:24.850
You forgot?

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:32.850
Fine. I'm on a diet, so I
.shouldn't eat it anyway.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.750
Haruka...

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.910
I'm sorry.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:37.820
It's fine, really.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:45.860
The eldest sister is in a bad mood.

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:48.840
It's because you wanted to eat her donut.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:50.400
Go apologize.

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.120
You two are the ones who ate it!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.350
But it's <i>your</i> fault for
.not knowing whose it was.

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:56.510
You ate the cinnamon one.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.600
Two to one.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.640
It's your fault.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.260
A majority vote isn't fair!
How am I meant to win?!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.950
No, a majority vote is fine.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.020
Yeah, it's fine.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.220
Two to one.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.600
Majority vote it is.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.740
Stop it already!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:25.040
We need to do something to cheer her up.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.860
You two help out.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:27.910
Sure.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.250
This is so relaxing.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:40.240
This outfit's so embarrassing
.and hard to move in.

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:41.900
Can't I just take it off?

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.130
Don't be stupid.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:48.440
We already agreed we'd atone for eating Haruka-neesama's donut by cleaning the house.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:50.300
I never agreed to be a maid!

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:55.480
Don't you know how to please your master?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:59.440
That's just what I'd expect from a
.spoiled youngest child like you.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.220
You're the youngest in your family too!

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:06.360
That's enough. Today's the
day I set you straight!

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.830
Chiaki, Touma.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.660
Haruka-neesama!

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.130
Haruka...

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:26.350
Thanks for doing the cleaning for me.

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:27.890
I'll get started on dinner soon.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.850
Oh, right. Where did Kana go?

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.100
Kana?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:47.280
I can't... put on this maid outfit... Master...

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:03.550
I leap in on the tips of my toes

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:23.040
Welcome home, Master!

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.750
Don't hesitate to ask for anything!

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:25.660
Really?

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:26.130
Then...

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:30.370
Next time: "The Man Sweats Under the Blue Summer Sky."

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:31.660
Could you give me a shoulder massage?

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.220
Do it yourself, Master.
